Today is my moving day.
The room is almost empty.
My suitcase stands under the window.
It is big and heavy.
My laptop lies on the bed.
I pack it carefully into the backpack.
My sweater lies next to the laptop.
I pack the sweater too.
Then I close the backpack.
My jacket lies on the suitcase.
I take the jacket and my backpack.
The room is now empty.
Everything is ready.
I open the door.
I pull the suitcase into the hallway.
My new flat is in the same building.
The way is short.
I am ready for my new home.
